    "updated_at": "2021-11-30T12:42:57Z",
    "body": "We are also interested in having support for \"deflate-raw\" as it is required for zipping. With \"gzip\" or \"deflate\" formats, additional workarounds would be required which is not very neat. So, it would be super helpful if raw compression format can be supported.\r\nThanks!",
